      "sourceURL": "https://raffaellabichiri.myportfolio.com/art-direction",
      "description": "An editorial exploring the kitchen as a place for introspection. Through the figure of Chef Francesco, the series draws on psychoanalytic and surrealist cues: ritual, repetition, control, and release. Taste becomes both a sensory and emotional language, connecting food and fashion through subjectivity.",
